NOTE ON SCOPE

This license covers the Neptun open-source framework: the backtesting and
evaluation engine, strategy templates, statistics utilities, and examples.

It does NOT grant any rights to, and this repository deliberately does not
contain, proprietary trading strategies, signal definitions, factor or scoring
research, private datasets, or research notes. Those remain the private
property of their authors. See SECURITY.md and the project README for the
public/private boundary.
